{"type":"message","id":"cd000618","parentId":"b28f32ba","timestamp":"2026-03-18T12:59:04.057Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Structuring the response**\n\nI need to respond in a way that feels personal while being clear. The user asked to run a pipeline, not to discuss symptoms, so a straightforward summary would be best. I should mention that a heatmap was sent and suggest using an LLM distillator in line with the tools, but only after the tool actually runs. I have to be careful not to suggest any diagnoses, emphasizing that this is a preliminary evaluation.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_007ee785528742940169baa18e5ec8819181b96501e6814075\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpuqGWTTuUy9HTiNQhpx8yOxK9HNDAcL-J0S1TbGziS5JiCj5oyiMv-R5XkEV_idXH5XaX2dmfN-KlNwsrvvOiZht1Wfo-mGN95B_7p7ZdrUBMi1SP1THTw4s-4rQ5DzCB8dkYcPCnF9kn4soK6ayTMVW-FjqJptx2b75WNNsjNeHhIaaWYTke25sgn9wNJohdMbxpgKq68N_a2W4HNpoD_G3SYgFi6mrHkzVvEw6K0z5LZqc-gM1ddTNTB77ZBlFnflPYPyZPJSZI5JyOQdEqgJp4ZgIniVQAWhm-nLiLBCyJg4k7RCmKNwCtn2B754c0SZqn_MNNpKcBAepjY_i1GJqRq4nnKkyjBQVgH9PNGuzMTTlxJgFaVZef6OlNEK5bJQmdEeBUM8fFHr-7WCwvq79L52j22VnIW8JA2-5HCM2000_0lagqszSD01G7pL0p8ps00Bqy-IBqS1rSAQydjKCGJlmu-bt8m2O-agBhDW09OMoGiSFUUm89-CaEfsDYOuBIYgnMpfbouEUR0U7Y2J3Ph1Kbuh6tNnGBDBjuvEMjT9bdmBYyF3Hn3XDWWVIO51kZXyGMtqYSjuvQKps2tHJ6WxymgN8XkobcvS_3-mBA_yahfYJJ5ZAOiUfQX2p9scjjl_HqeGBlpdHLMF82suF0boHeTszyUwFggjrm9iQWgGOIHSdpdMP-sKF79WcH0u6FxMvgGUgXMIrMPy8GO-1CThSh7Zr7ay4i3r-7kPUqW9NRdLSEdJytsfngBaASR9WnC6KGyPTLvyGhsPZKcB8AXzVyqfXxoPtJVziH6PiZZzcGfaZctpe3RNArwzWtd7K1N39CUl6VibnE2BPRkGks59_7WmIxsMfsaiTggJs2V123khZCg-F7jRObSXqt2vIlvDOUs5ILvFAmZpiEKri02NBgFGlHHx0hmqnd0qJu4t47yNoenXH-8ronLZNFPq54imD0DARLbxvJ2rfNc0KU7y2GuL7O4wC2v8sN4mfoMUHos8VNwPvcTtGuaH18giB9eZVpoJjcX9YxZR8BYyPH25dVobtcPWVe5SOYeJ2pDEB_PPFmRDmT6Qcy3dPDWhgz387kE5cxfjVYzYToZShEC2unpTG-xwSpe59vXfDisALkKvjYNilXt_kD58xBR_FkFSm3c6xk9mHLiqrt93BGYpuv-56RhnvLyoWP0n19X6ygmEjyQ-vqa0DDe7z6BeuM2ZgszGgnS4Ad3xtrmZkYOg==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Structuring the response**\\n\\nI need to respond in a way that feels personal while being clear. The user asked to run a pipeline, not to discuss symptoms, so a straightforward summary would be best. I should mention that a heatmap was sent and suggest using an LLM distillator in line with the tools, but only after the tool actually runs. I have to be careful not to suggest any diagnoses, emphasizing that this is a preliminary evaluation.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] I ran the kidney cancer detection pipeline on your image.\n\n**Preliminary tool summary**\n- **Kidney cancer class:** `kidney_tumor`\n- **Confidence:** **99.998%**\n- **Image Analyzer prediction:** `kidney_tumor`\n\n**Heatmap / visual attention findings**\n- **CAM coverage:** 0.0128\n- **CAM center ratio:** 0.825\n- **CAM left-right asymmetry:** 0.10\n- **CAM top-bottom asymmetry:** 1.00\n- **CAM explanation:** the model focused on a small, localized central region within the kidney area, with asymmetric distribution, which the analyzer interpreted as a visually distinct renal region that may fit a localized structural abnormality.\n\n**X-AI component summary**\n- **Confidence interpretation:** the system labels this as a very high-confidence result, but also notes that imaging analysis alone is **not** a definitive diagnostic test.\n- **Summary:** the downstream explanation says the image suggests a high likelihood of a kidney tumor / kidney cancer pattern on this scan.\n- **Visual evidence:** it reports a detected renal tumor pattern.\n\n**Recommended next steps from the pipeline**\n1. Further medical evaluation with appropriate imaging/lab review  \n2. Discussion with a qualified clinician/urologist/radiologist  \n3. Consider additional confirmatory testing if the treating team thinks it is needed\n\nI also sent back the analyzer heatmap image to this chat.\n\n**Important:** this is a **preliminary tool output, not an actual diagnosis**. If you want, I can now help you interpret what this means clinically in plain language, or I can give you the **raw pipeline response**.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_007ee785528742940169baa196bcdc8191ad5d189eab61e873\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":9618,"output":414,"cacheRead":12544,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":22576,"cost":{"input":0.024045,"output":0.00621,"cacheRead":0.003136,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.033391000000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773838733284}}
